# P4 (ref/ff-imx-port-plan.md): the Project Settings page on the Tracker+ and Mini sims, which have no plugin host. File screen, F7 opens it: the
# rows of project.mtff (4 FX Slots, Strum volume, Random seed, Reroll seed, Scale snap), no Stereo pairs row (stereo pairs are MK66 only).
# Replay: bun replay.ts synth-open/tools/ui_shot/flows/plus_only_project_settings.flow --target sim --model plus --offline --ui <ui_shot> (plus_flows.sh)
title: Project Settings page on Tracker+ (P4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

tap File
wait 800ms
tap F7
wait 1000ms
expect text "4 FX Slots"
shot proj-settings
expect peek fxslots 2
tap F8
wait 600ms
tap Down
wait 600ms
tap F8
wait 1500ms
shot proj-4fx-on
expect peek fxslots 4
